  "semantic": {
    "lines": [
      "Warp Gate is a transfer point that allows players to move",
      "a place to another. There are many warp gates in different",
      "regions. Ones in Pilai and Ricarten can be used freely but,",
      "for other places, you must receive a wing item from the",
      "warp gate inventor in Ricarten."
    ]
